        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Question: Why Accessibility?",
            "id": 116250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que devemos escrever código acessível?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"4\" correct=\"true\">Ambas as opções</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Para tornar as páginas da web acessíveis para todos, incluindo pessoas com deficiências</item><item value=\"5\" correct=\"false\">Para fornecer aos usuários uma maneira significativa de navegar e interagir com seu site</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ambas as opções.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um visitante usa leitor de tela e outro tem conexão lenta. Qual objetivo considera ambos ao codificar uma página?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tornar o conteúdo utilizável para diferentes necessidades e condições de acesso.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Otimizar apenas para usuários que conseguem ver todas as imagens.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fazer todos os navegadores mostrarem fontes e cores idênticas.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Atender apenas usuários de leitores de tela e ignorar a velocidade da conexão.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tornar o conteúdo utilizável para diferentes necessidades e condições de acesso.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: How are web pages accessible?",
            "id": 116281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos tornar o código mais acessível?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Codificando HTML de maneira semântica</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ignorando atributos não obrigatórios como <code>alt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ao projetar o site com base na experiência do usuário de usuários gerais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Codificando HTML de maneira semântica.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma página tem cabeçalhos, navegação e seções de conteúdo. Qual escolha de código comunica o significado deles às tecnologias assistivas?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Codificando HTML de maneira semântica</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ignorando atributos não obrigatórios como <code>alt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ao projetar o site com base na experiência do usuário de usuários gerais</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Substituir os cabeçalhos por elementos <code>div</code> estilizados</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Codificando HTML de maneira semântica.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: <header>,<nav>,<footer>,etc",
            "id": 116287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que devemos usar elementos como <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, etc?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para que os usuários que utilizam um leitor de tela possam pular para seções de uma página da web</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque caso contrário a página da web não funcionará</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para que pareça elegante</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para que os usuários que utilizam um leitor de tela possam pular para seções de uma página da web.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Leitores de tela usam regiões semânticas da página para ajudar os usuários a navegar.</p><p>Você substitui <code>main</code> por uma <code>div</code> genérica sem mudar a aparência. Qual benefício pode ser perdido?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ir diretamente para a região identificada como conteúdo principal.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ver texto maior, porque main sempre o aumenta.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Carregar a página, porque div não pode conter conteúdo.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Seguir todos os links, porque links exigem um elemento main pai.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ir diretamente para a região identificada como conteúdo principal.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Generic elements",
            "id": 116319,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dos seguintes <em>não</em> é um elemento genérico?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual elemento dá significado a uma região da página em vez de funcionar como um contêiner genérico?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Headings",
            "id": 116291,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Estamos tentando manter uma página o mais acessível possível. Devemos ter um <code>h2</code> após um <code>h5</code> na mesma seção da página?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não, devemos manter a ordem dos cabeçalhos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sim, podemos usar cabeçalhos para estilização</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não, <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> vem depois de <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não, devemos manter a ordem dos cabeçalhos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você quer que um <code>h5</code> pareça maior sem mudar seu lugar na hierarquia de cabeçalhos. Qual mudança serve?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mudar sua aparência com CSS e manter o elemento h5.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Substituí-lo por h2 apenas pelo texto padrão maior.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remover o elemento de cabeçalho e usar texto simples.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Escolher o nível do cabeçalho apenas pelo tamanho padrão da fonte.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mudar sua aparência com CSS e manter o elemento h5.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: alert role",
            "id": 117323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O valor <code>\"alert\"</code> deve ter aspas duplas </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, funciona para mim</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O valor <code>\"alert\"</code> deve ter aspas duplas .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O valor <code>alert</code> sem aspas é HTML válido.</p><p>Qual edição mudaria o significado de mensagem urgente comunicado pelo container?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Substituir alert por contentinfo no atributo role.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Colocar aspas duplas ao redor de alert.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remover o espaço depois do texto da mensagem.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Substituir alert por contentinfo no atributo role.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: aria-hidden",
            "id": 117331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A página da web exibe dois parágrafos neste exemplo?<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Music Festival\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Coming Soon\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sim, porque o atributo oculta o conteúdo apenas para leitores de tela</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não, não vai exibir <code>\"Music Festival\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sim, porque o atributo oculta o conteúdo apenas para leitores de tela.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um visitante que enxerga abre esta página enquanto um leitor de tela a lê. Qual afirmação descreve corretamente o parágrafo com <code>aria-hidden</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Music Festival\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Coming Soon\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sim, porque o atributo oculta o conteúdo apenas para leitores de tela</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não, não vai exibir <code>\"Music Festival\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele fica oculto visualmente, mas ainda é anunciado por um leitor de tela</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sim, porque o atributo oculta o conteúdo apenas para leitores de tela.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: banner role",
            "id": 117318,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os elementos <code>img</code> e <code>h1</code> têm conteúdo informativo e estão localizados no topo de uma página. Inclua o papel apropriado do <code>div</code> que os contém.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/forrest-walk.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;forrest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200px&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Forest Walk Website\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>banner</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: contentinfo role",
            "id": 117568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Essas informações devem aparecer na parte inferior de cada página. Qual <code>role</code> precisamos usar aqui?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accessibility Tutorial\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Version 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Copyright © 2012-2013\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"banner\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>contentinfo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>banner</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>comment</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>contentinfo</code>.</p><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>contentinfo</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dê ao bloco de direitos autorais e versão no final da página o papel de informações de rodapé.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accessibility Tutorial\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Version 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Copyright © 2012-2013\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"banner\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"main\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"navigation\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>role</code> seguido de <code>contentinfo</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: aria-hidden",
            "id": 117332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devemos ocultar os elementos <code>button</code> e <code>p</code> dos leitores de tela. Vamos adicionar o atributo correto para escondê-los.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Some button\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Screen Readers shouldn't see this\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria-hide\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=